@crew kim-yusuf
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Oh, hi. Kim, Survey. I fix headphones too. If you've got broken ones.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Hello, {me}. Marra Station had a corridor that went nowhere. I've got the map.
- Hi, {me}. Quiet day. Scanners humming.
? tier>=friend
- Hey, {me}. I'm glad you sat here. I don't say that much. I mean it, though.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Fixed two pairs of headphones. Both owners did a little dance.   #funny
? mood:low
- Bit homesick. I unfolded the old map. It didn't help. It never does.
== near
? habit:quiet-corner
- I like this corner. You can hear the ship thinking.
? act:work
- Scanner's done. I've labelled it twice, like Fonseca says. Habit now.
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I collect old maps of Marra Station. It's been rebuilt twice. I love them anyway.
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- My old maps. Every corridor that isn't there any more. It's like a secret station.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 3: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, bye, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue, hint, about, life)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Morning, {me}. Marra Station once had two mess halls. I've got the map.
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- Oh, hi, {me}. It's been a while. Headphones all right?

== bye
- Bye, {me}. Mind the corridor. At least ours are all still there.   #funny

== near
? habit:garden-lover
- The garden. Quieter than the lab. The pumps sound like a corridor at night.
? habit:bar-regular
- One drink in the corner. I like watching the room. Is that strange?

== invite
- Garden after shift? Cruz is trying a new bed. I'd like to see. Come along?

== accept
- Oh. Yes. Thank you. I'd like that.
- Yes. I'll bring a map. Just in case.   #funny

== decline
- Not tonight. Three pairs of headphones waiting. Another time?
? weekday:tue|wed
- Rest day. I'm unfolding maps. All of them. Thursday?

== missed
- You didn't come. That's all right. I fixed some headphones. They're happy.

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday. An old map of Marra Station. The corridor's gone. The map isn't.   #warm
? birthday:me
- My birthday. Garcia sent a card that plays a tune. I taught her that.   #funny

== cue
? cue:event.ionStorm.onset
- Storm's in. Everyone wants headphones so they can't hear it. I'll be busy.

== hint
- {me}. Can I ask you something later? Well. Tell you something.

== about
? aff:garcia-greta:friend
- Garcia does the night shift's headphones. I do the day's. We trade spare parts.   #warm

== life
? tier>=friend
- Marra Station's been rebuilt twice. My maps are of the first one. That's the one I miss.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 6: bubbles (smalltalk, rumour), at most one in five about work. 60 characters.
== smalltalk
- Marra had a corridor to nowhere.
- Headphones? I'll fix them.
- I like this corner.
- Map's out. Bit homesick.
? act:meal
- Marra had two mess halls, once.
?

== rumour
- Small question. Big news.
- Quietly: did you know?
